..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ange recalls the photograph of Novikov's murdered body at the crime scene that the interrogator had shown her. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The familiar signs of torture... The familiar dagger-to-the-neck... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Only someone who knows her extremely well could possibly know about these things, but there is no such person in the world anymore."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AN94","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,50"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AN-94","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ange?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":19,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Come. Let's see which debt this nemesis would like to settle with me."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"2021summer_SecurityBureau","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Test Subject","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Captain Ganglati, as you expected, the target has forced her way out of Griffin's encirclement and is heading this way."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Pamzan","expression":10,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-70"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"???","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Send a forward squad to draw her to our forces lying in ambush."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Pamzan","expression":10,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-70"}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Test Subject","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We have done that, but she seemed to be able to tell where she would be ambushed along the way... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"She evaded all the traps. The two Dolls accompanying her are al