 you..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Pamzan","expression":10,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-70"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"???","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Commander Angelia, it is a pleasure to see you again."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Pamzan","expression":10,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-70"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ganglati","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I hope you still remember me. I am Ganglati."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":19,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ganglati...?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The pistol suddenly feels incredibly heavy in Ange's hands. She grits her teeth and aims it at the wiry figure."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":22,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Why are you... Who did this to you? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You were dead... You died right in front of me..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Pamzan","expression":10,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-70"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ganglati","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Oh, Death, the gates of Abaddon, claimed me, but Teacher held out a hand to me."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":22,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...It's her! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"She's the one who did this to you?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Pamzan","expression":10,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-70"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ganglati","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Indeed. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Otherwise, I would not have the chance to seek vengeance."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":fa